WEBVTT

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>Ruflppe</i>

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.380
- lkusawa and...
- ...Kurogane...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.540
...went somewhere!

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.310
Excellent, but I want
one more task from you.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.850
If you promise to
truly acknowledge me...

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:35.710
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.900
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.490
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.040
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.040
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.440
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.000
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.320
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:13.750
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.470
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.730
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:25.110
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.870
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:32.010
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:35.950
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.750
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.990
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:45.290
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:51.820
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.480
6 of hearts!

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.680
4 of spades!

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.050
2 of diamonds!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.180
Wow, that's amazing!

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.880
Are you clairvoyant?!

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:20.550
No, I just can figure things out.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:24.550
Things like tomorrow's weather
and what everyone is thinking.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.990
Everything Mitsuoka does is amazing!

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:30.530
And he's good-looking,
smart, and rich, too!

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.450
EIGHT YEARS AGO, 1962

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.070
EIGHT YEARS AGO, 1962
Don't do it, Dad!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.480
What's wrong, Yuji?

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:47.380
If you do, your company
will be ruined!

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.350
You shouldn't do it!

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.120
Don't be like that, Yuji...

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.960
I don't expect a child to understand,
but the economy is on the uprise...

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.520
I'm telling you the truth!!

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.290
<i>Yuji!</i>

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.310
Dad...

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:13.040
I tried to warn you.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.680
Isn't that Mr. Mitsuoka's kid?

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.380
Yeah. His dad's dead, but
nobody's offered to take him in.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:26.550
That's because they say he insists
that he can foresee the future.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.420
Who'd want a freak like that?

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.500
Hey, it's Mitsuoka!

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:39.870
<i>Ew!</i>

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.380
Let's go play over there
before he reads our minds!

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:44.310
Yeah, let's go!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.270
MEATLOAF12O YEN

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.750
(34 yen)

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.090
Hey, brat!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.360
You're driving my
customers away! Beat it!!

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.660
I... I'm sorry.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.370
And don't come back!!

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.370
CREDITORS ONLY
KEEP OUT

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.010
This is the place! Make it quick!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.850
Mister...?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.920
I see now! That's how it was!!

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:33.950
You've come to take
away our valuables!!

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:37.460
Don't be absurd!
I was asked by your father to...

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:39.230
YOU'RE LYING!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.890
I know everything. I know
what you ate for breakfast...

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.230
...the names of your children!
I know everythingl!

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.480
Hurry up!!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:58.680
Stupid freaky kid!

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.870
You are...

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.930
...an ant by the side of the road.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:27.910
No, you're even worse.
You are a maggot!!

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.510
Wh- What the hell are
you blithering about?!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.320
<i>YOU DAMNED MAGGOT!!!</i>

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.660
Help me!!

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:05.710
The boy named Yuji Mitsuoka
is the evil gate keeper?

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.580
Is this Shadow's true identity, sir?

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.280
There is almost no doubt.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:16.390
The eyewitness report details
a black ring produced by the boy.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:22.030
His exceptional insight is most
likely attributed to gate power.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:27.800
His gate exists to absorb limitless knowledge
for the sake of finding a happy future.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:34.570
Terrific sorrow and hate
transformed his gate into a black gate.

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.790
It must have been
really horrible for him.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.620
That's true...

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:46.320
Yeah, but there's no law says it's okay
for him to kidnap Princess Ruriko and Megumi!!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:50.950
You're right.
The evil gate keeper, Yuji Mitsuoka...

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:56.230
...is probably leading the invaders
along with the two executives.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:07:00.860
Y- Yes, yes, but! Why has he
kidnapped Ruri and Megumi?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:05.900
Do you suppose...
...he's taking more hostages?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.480
We don't know.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.910
POLITICAL THOUGHTS CLUB
GENERAL RALLY

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:21.020
You've all come here without
knowing you're being used...

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.260
...foolish maggots.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.430
You there!
Please keep the line straight!

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:32.270
We have put down our ideas
on paper. Please read them!

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:37.770
Everyone in group A,
please see to the north entrance!

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:41.670
But it won't be long now
until I may crush underfoot...

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:46.050
...every maggot in the world
who looked down upon me back then.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:51.290
<i>Ridiculous! This has nothing
to do with our plan, Shadow!</i>

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.050
Hm?

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.620
Oh, it's you two.

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:03.600
<i>Our objective is to instigate
war on humankind for eternity...</i>

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:09.840
<i>...so we may collect their energy
of hate. To make a human energy farm.</i>

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.470
<i>Don't tell me you have forgotten?</i>

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:20.440
<i>When you were still very young,
we lent you our invader energy.</i>

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.720
SHUT UP!

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.990
<i>What... ?!</i>

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:34.330
I knew from the beginning that
you thought of me as a mere tool.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.530
However, it's going to
be different from now on.

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:40.470
It's <i>my</i> turn to use you!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.100
<i>Curse you...!</i>

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.710
OPEN THE GATE!!

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:21.640
How do you like your new body?
You have been reborn as my slaves.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.610
Be grateful!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.790
Registering a paranormal frequency
of preposterous proportions, sir!

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:33.020
10,000 times normal!!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.560
What?!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:37.660
Gate Keeper team, emergency launch!!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.660
Go to Tokyo Tower to ascertain
the source of the signal!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.670
Roger, AEGIS!

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:16.330
Ms. Ochiai! Give emergency notice to
all mechanics of the Far Eastern branch!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.830
Have all super-weapons ready
for immediate launch at any time!

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.340
Yes, sir!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.610
<i>I don't know why, but I
have a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:31.520
Wh- What on earth is that?!

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:36.050
That's right!
I remember that today...!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.990
...there's a Political Thoughts
Club gathering at Tokyo Towerl!

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.860
Do you mean Kageyama's club?!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:48.470
<i>Todays weather is for clear skies,
Today's weather is for clear skies!</i>

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:51.170
<i>You, there!
The high school students! I'm sorry...</i>

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:54.830
<i>but could you guys kindly scoot over
to the side of the road for a moment?</i>

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.170
What?

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.470
<i>You high school students over there!
Please make way!</i>
lt's a mean looking student punk!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:01.810
<i>- I am Chotaro Banba.</i>
Hey, isn't that a government bus?

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:03.910
<i>Heads up, everyone!</i>

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:08.650
<i>People have arrived at our gathering
who disapprove our right to opine!</i>

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.650
<i>They are our enemies!</i>

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:15.430
<i>Once before, they attempted
to prevent President Kageyama...</i>

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.790
<i>from voicing his opinion at WHK Hall!</i>

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.470
What? ls she talking...
about us?!

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:23.470
<i>They are the enemy!
They are the enemy!</i>

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.600
<i>They are the enemy!!!</i>

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:31.170
They've all come to us!

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:34.810
We can't get to Tokyo Tower like this!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:43.180
Good, good!
Buy me a little more time.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:47.290
Now! Use these repulsive steel towers
to broadcast paranormal frequencies...

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:49.260
...over all Japanll

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.160
Oh. my god!!

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.330
What's wrong?!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.910
The paranormal frequencies
are growing even stronger!!

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.200
A resonance effect is occurring!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:07.470
The range of the paranormal frequencies
is starting to widen!

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:12.850
No! At this rate, dormant invaders
all over Japan will awaken!

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:23.290
Go home! Go home! Go home!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.690
Reiko, use your Gate of Illusion!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.170
Roger!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.200
Here it comes...!

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:33.200
GATE OPEN!

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:46.610
So that's the creepy music
Mr. Kageyama spoke of...

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:51.280
We're all set here!
It's ready to go at any time.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:54.790
Very well then...

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:56.660
...start the music!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.300
<i>You maggots buried in the muck!</i>

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:07.270
<i>What a dirty world you all live in!</i>

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.310
<i>Filled with chromium, mercury, cadmium...</i>

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.610
It's no good!
We're being pushed back!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.740
Damn! There's no choice...

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.720
No! Don't!!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.720
My god!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.020
Everyone! Band togethefl!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.530
We're going to flip the bus!

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.390
Yeah!!

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:34.030
Heave-ho!

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.630
We have no choice! Charge!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.900
But do not harm them under
any circumstances!! Got it?!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.340
<i>Roger.!</i>

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.380
Let's go!
You got it!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.650
Explosive Panda Fire Ball!!

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:54.650
Short stopping Vacuous Missiles!

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:58.350
Here! I'd be careful if l were you!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:00.390
You'll be seriously injured
if you let 'em hit you!

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:02.860
We can't get near them at this rate!

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:06.260
Please...

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.660
...stand aside!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.030
This is intensely weird!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.660
Everybody, run!!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.140
Now, Kaoru!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.910
Right!

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:25.970
Please hurry, Gate Keepers!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.710
Commander, emergency!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:31.980
We're receiving reports of
invader outbreaks all across Japan!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:35.090
It's finally begun.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:43.500
Stop it...! What do you mean,
return to your true self?!

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:47.110
What are you talking about?

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.400
Send emergency notices
to all regions! Hurry!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:30.780
We are in the middle of emergency
warnings! Return to your posts!

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.820
Commander

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.450
Don't tell me...!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.120
Invaders?!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.500
Something is over there!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.270
What?! Where?!

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:59.940
There's no doubt about it!
The paranormal frequency is originating from it!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:06.280
Okay, let's go!
OPEN THE GATE!

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:08.580
Here goes!!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.390
I'm here, Invader!

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:24.470
Hi. Long time no see, I guess!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.970
Kageyama... What are you doing here?

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.670
<i>I mean... it's dangerous to be here!
Get out of here, quickly!</i>

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.810
You still haven't realized yet, have you?

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.110
Huh?

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.420
All right then, I'll tell you.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:45.490
GATE OPEN.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:51.460
It can't be...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.800
Have you finally clued in?
That's right...

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:59.030
<i>...the evil gate keeper
your team calls "Shadow"...</i>

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.170
...is me!

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:09.080
<i>Now, fight me!</i>

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.580
Stop it! Stop it, Kageyama!

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:14.380
<i>You're only under invader control!</i>

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:16.550
Oh?

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.220
<i>Shadow Edge!</i>

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:23.300
My Special alloy body...!

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:27.290
What's the matter, Ukiya?
I told you before, remember?

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.270
If you really do have
something you want to protect...

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:33.400
...do it, no matter what
sacrifice that entails.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.740
<i>I know that, Kageyama!
But this is some kind of mistake!</i>

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:41.970
You can't be the evil gate keeper!

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:45.050
Mistaken?

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:53.650
<i>See? There you have it.</i>

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.490
NO! NO! NO! NO!

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.930
Kageyama has lightening reflexes...

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:02.330
...he's loved by everyone,
he's good at schoolwork...

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:05.600
...and he gave me self-confidence
when I was feeling confused!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:08.400
The Kageyama I know isn't evil!!

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:11.980
Oh...? But you know
it already, don't you?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:16.340
My real name.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:21.020
Yuji... Mitsuoka?

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:24.310
You know, don't you?!!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:30.030
Vacuous...

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:33.960
...Missile!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.740
<i>It must have been really horrible for him.</i>

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:43.230
Fool!

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:49.480
<i>You are definitely Shun Ukiya!</i>

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.280
<i>A man with a passion hotter
than the magma under the earth...</i>

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:56.450
<i>...and a heart so soft it doesn't
hold back sympathy, even for the enemy.</i>

00:18:57.020 --> 00:19:02.520
However, that is what we call
a mere hot-blooded fool!!

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:10.330
<i>It displeased me so much,
I felt sick...!!</i>

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:14.270
<i>That an idiot like you who practically
lives believing the goodwill of others...</i>

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.310
<i>actually exists in this world!</i>

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:21.570
That's why I approached you,
fully intending to rip apart your fool heart.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.820
I...

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:31.080
I... don't care.
I still believe... in you.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:36.350
Are you still saying that nonsense,
Mr. Maggot?

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:39.490
Very well, look at this!!!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.210
Rurippe! And Megumi!

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:53.910
<i>Don't call my name
like you're my friend.</i>

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.810
With the cooperation of
my powerful ally, Megumi Kurogane...

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:00.750
...Ruriko lkusawa has
fallen into my clutches!

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:02.290
Wham?!

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:08.650
And I will call forth the feelings of hate
dormant within Ruriko lkusawa...

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:11.160
...to create a minus gate!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.200
Minus gate?

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:18.160
The Gate of Life reversed.

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:23.270
A Gate of Massacre capable of robbing
all forms of life in the blink of an eye!

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.410
Kageyama...

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:30.110
<i>KAGEYAMA!!!</i>

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:36.210
Too slow!

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:49.770
<i>Without your precious gate engine...</i>

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:53.700
<i>...your gate robot is
just a pile of iron scrap metal!</i>

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:57.510
<i>Thank you, Ukiya. Thanks to you,
I had a pleasant school life.</i>

00:20:57.510 --> 00:21:01.570
Thank you, Ukiya. Thanks to you,
I had a pleasant school life.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:06.210
Your death...
will be my graduation ceremonyl!

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:12.480
<i>What?</i>

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.930
<i>Is this gate power?!</i>

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.800
I'm here.

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:22.930
Yukino...?

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:27.000
I don't want to see Saemi sad.

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.670
Open, Portal oriflce.

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:35.740
I don't believe it!
The Far Eastern branch...

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:39.270
...has been concealing
a gate keeper of this caliber?!

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:42.250
<i>Megumi, we're retreating!</i>

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.120
All right.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.220
Stop...

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:57.260
<i>Ukiya! Stop me if you can!</i>

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.610
Though I already know
you still aren't capable of it!

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:08.380
Rurippe...

00:22:09.250 --> 00:22:11.220
I'm...

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:14.380
...just like he said.

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:18.680
I'm just...

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:20.780
...a maggot.

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:40.100
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:43.970
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:48.940
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:52.310
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:54.450
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:59.620
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:02.960
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:07.590
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:12.460
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:17.090
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:23.870
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
